    'excerpt'     => 'Most dog diarrhea clears up on its own within a day or two, but blood, vomiting, a dog who stops eating, or a puppy with loose stool all change the picture. Here is how to tell which kind you are dealing with, what a sensible bland diet looks like, and how to get the mess out of the carpet.',
